security_hardening.remediation:
Add path validation to ensure requested paths are within allowed project directories:
```typescript
function isPathWithinProject(requestedPath: string, projectPath: string): boolean {
  const resolved = path.resolve(requestedPath);
  const projectResolved = path.resolve(projectPath);
  return resolved.startsWith(projectResolved + path.sep);
}
```
Maintain a list of allowed base paths from registered projects and reject requests outside these boundaries. The existing `isPathSafe()` utility in shell-escape.ts can be extended for this purpose.

